   "source": [
    "### Separate SW90 and SW17\n",
    "**Purpose:** Filter by `station_id` and create two independent DataFrames. SW90 is our **target station**. SW17 is considered a **potential additional measurement source** that might improve forecasts at SW90."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "Px3g2vugBiYn"
   },
