    "### Check class imbalance\n",
    "**Purpose:** Count both labels by station. The saved results show **SW90: 1,773 zeros and 53 ones; SW17: 1,796 zeros and 30 ones** over the full period. The SW90 positive class is only about **2.9%** of all days. A model can therefore achieve very high Accuracy by mostly predicting `0`; we will evaluate flood detection separately."
