   "source": [
    "### Focus on actual floods and false alarms\n",
    "**Purpose:** Select days where the real label is `1` **or** the model predicts `1`. This removes the many uninteresting correctly predicted no-flood days and allows us to inspect the **seven recorded floods and one false alarm** for this model. Disagreement with a label is an investigation trigger, not proof that the label is wrong."
