   "source": [
    "## 5. Add SW17 as a measurement station\n",
    "### Merge observations by their calendar date\n",
    "**Purpose:** Join SW90 and SW17 daily measurements on `date`. The target label comes **only from SW90**; SW17 contributes rainfall, soil moisture and discharge, but never its own next-day flood label. The one-to-one merge yields **1,826 rows × 8 columns**. Matching by date is essential so that both stations refer to the same day in each chunk."
   ]
