   "source": [
    "### Build SW90 + SW17 three-day chunks\n",
    "**Purpose:** Apply the same sliding-window logic to both stations together. Each day contributes **six measurements** (three per station); three days give **18 features**. We retain the same SW90 next-day target. The saved result is **1,824 chunks × 20 columns** (18 features, target date, label). This isolates the impact of adding SW17 measurements without changing the forecast horizon."
   ]
  },
