   "source": [
    "### Compare flood probability scores, not only YES/NO\n",
    "**Purpose:** Use `predict_proba()` to see how SW17 changes each score. In particular, the combined model raised the June 19, 2024 score from approximately **0.13 to 0.42**, yet it remained below the usual 0.50 decision threshold. Such changes can be informative even when the class predictions are the same. They do **not** establish calibration or a causal role for SW17."
   ]
  },
