   "source": [
    "### Refit the full SW90 + SW17 Logistic Regression on validation\n",
    "**Purpose:** Apply the same training and validation dates to all **18 features**. Here the confusion matrix is **[[188, 5], [6, 5]]**, yielding **5/11 detected positive days** (Recall **0.45**, F1 about **0.48**). This suggests SW17 can help on some periods, **but** the earlier 2024 test showed the opposite. The evidence is therefore period-dependent."
