    "### Try class-weighted Logistic Regression\n",
    "**Purpose:** Fit `class_weight='balanced'` to give more influence to the rare positive class during training. Validation Recall rises to **8/11 = 0.73**, but the model produces **36 false alarms**; F1 drops to about **0.29**. Increasing sensitivity is not a free improvement—precision also matters for usable warnings."
   ]
  },
