   "source": [
    "### Change the classification threshold for the balanced model\n",
    "**Purpose:** Convert positive-class probability scores into 0/1 predictions using several thresholds (0.50 to 0.90). At 0.50 the model detects eight flood days with 36 false alarms; at 0.90 it detects five with 17 false alarms. A higher threshold generally reduces alarm frequency, but may miss more floods. Choosing a threshold requires a clear priority between missed floods and false alarms."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
