    "## 7. Random Forest — separate classifier\n",
    "### First ordinary Random Forest using both stations\n",
    "**Purpose:** Try `RandomForestClassifier` on the same 18 features and chronological train/test period. Random Forest uses multiple decision trees and **does not require `StandardScaler`**. Train Accuracy is **100%** and Test Accuracy around **98.17%**; such high training performance can indicate memorization/overfitting, but the flood-class metrics determine practical usefulness."
   ]
  },
