   "source": [
    "### Limit decision-tree depth (`max_depth=5`)\n",
    "**Purpose:** Try a simpler forest to reduce tree complexity. Saved Train Accuracy falls to **97.45%**, while Test Accuracy becomes **98.63%**. Its confusion matrix **[[431, 0], [6, 1]]** means **one** detected flood and **zero** false alarms. Precision is **1.00 only because there was one positive prediction**—this is *not* evidence of a highly reliable warning model. This parameter was explored after viewing test results, so the reported test improvement is exploratory."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 48,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
