   "source": [
    "### Record a cautious review status for three cases\n",
    "**Purpose:** Annotate March 21, 2024 as **uncertain** (low discharge, no independent confirmation found) and July 4–5 as **possible_label_mismatch** given external flood reports. This creates review metadata **without modifying `flood_within_24h`**. BSS reported flooding in Jamalpur and the Jamuna River above the danger level at Bahadurabad on those July dates; this supports further investigation but does not by itself establish that the dataset uses the same flood definition or timing.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Documented external references:** [BSS, July 4, 2024](https://www.bssnews.net/district/198417) and [BSS, July 5, 2024](https://www.bssnews.net/district/198642)."
   ]
