    "## 10. Seasonal baseline — June, July, August\n",
    "### Predict FLOOD from the month alone\n",
    "**Purpose:** Implement the simple rule agreed for this project: predict `1` when the **target day** falls in **June, July or August**, otherwise predict `0`. This baseline does not look at rainfall, moisture or discharge. On the **same 438 test windows**, it produces Accuracy **79.68%**, **5/7 detected flood days**, **87 false alarms**, Flood Recall **71.43%**, and Flood F1 approximately **0.101**. It is sensitive but not selective."
   ]
