   "source": [
    "### Train Logistic Regression for 48 hours\n",
    "**Purpose:** Standardize the features using the training data and train a Logistic Regression model. We then check training and test accuracy, but accuracy alone is not enough because flood labels are rare.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "# Standardization\n",
    "scaler_48h = StandardScaler()\n",
    "\n",
    "X_train_48h_scaled = scaler_48h.fit_transform(X_train_48h)\n",
    "X_test_48h_scaled = scaler_48h.transform(X_test_48h)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Logistic Regression\n",
    "log_model_48h = LogisticRegression(max_iter=1000)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Train model\n",
    "log_model_48h.fit(X_train_48h_scaled, y_train_48h)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Accuracy\n",
    "print(\"Train Accuracy:\", log_model_48h.score(X_train_48h_scaled, y_train_48h))\n",
    "print(\"Test Accuracy:\", log_model_48h.score(X_test_48h_scaled, y_test_48h))"
   ],
