    "### Compare with a simple seasonal baseline\n",
    "**Purpose:** Predict a flood for every test window in June, July or August and no flood in other months. This simple rule detects **8 of 12** flood-labeled days, but produces **84 false alarms**. It provides a useful reference point for the machine learning models.\n"
