    "### Final comparison of the 48-hour approaches\n",
    "**Purpose:** Put Accuracy, Precision, Recall and F1-score into one table. Logistic Regression has the highest flood F1-score (**0.32**), while the seasonal baseline has the highest flood Recall (**0.67**). The results show why we need several metrics instead of focusing only on accuracy.\n"
   ]
  },
